proceed←Warn msg;text;F1;form;obj;evt;ok
⍝ Pop up a GUI warning dialog listing msg (a vector of character-vector lines)
⍝ with Proceed/Abort buttons. Returns 1 to proceed with the build, 0 to abort.

 text←msg '' 'Proceed with the build?'
 (form←'F1') ⎕WC'Form' 'Build Warning' ('Size' 220 520)('Coord' 'Pixel')
 (form,'.TXT') ⎕WC'Text' (⍕⍪text) (10 10)
 (ok←form,'.PRO') ⎕WC'Button' 'Proceed' ('Posn' 180 300)('Size' 28 90)('Event' 'Select' 1)
 (form,'.CAN') ⎕WC'Button' 'Abort' ('Posn' 180 410)('Size' 28 90)('Event' 'Select' 1)
 :Repeat
     (obj evt)←2↑⎕DQ form
 :Until evt≡'Select'
 proceed←obj≡ok
